[{"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.163", "id": 400384835, "tag_name": "v0.2.163", "name": "v0.2.163", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-09-30T19:47:42Z", "published_at": "2026-09-30T19:47:45Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.286\n- CI: pinned the model for issue triage to fix failures caused by the CLI's new default model (#1328)\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.163/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.163\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.162", "id": 399489221, "tag_name": "v0.2.162", "name": "v0.2.162", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-09-29T20:08:03Z", "published_at": "2026-09-29T20:08:08Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.285\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.162/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.162\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.161", "id": 398534476, "tag_name": "v0.2.161", "name": "v0.2.161", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-09-28T18:55:15Z", "published_at": "2026-09-28T18:55:17Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.284\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.161/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.161\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.160", "id": 396964116, "tag_name": "v0.2.160", "name": "v0.2.160", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-09-25T22:32:27Z", "published_at": "2026-09-25T22:32:31Z", "body": "\n### Bug Fixes\n\n- **Fixed follow-up turns failing after background subagents**: When using `query()` with hooks, `can_use_tool`, or SDK MCP servers, stdin was closed too early if a subagent finished just before the turn's result arrived. Follow-up turns would then fail with \"Stream closed\" and the model would report the tool as refused. The SDK now listens for the CLI's `session_state_changed` messages and keeps stdin open until the CLI reports `idle`, matching the TypeScript SDK's behavior. A bounded wait ceiling (configurable via `CLAUDE_CODE_PRINT_BG_WAIT_CEILING_MS`, default 10 minutes) prevents indefinite hangs. Older CLIs without state events fall back to the previous close-at-first-result behavior. (#1190, #1279)\n\n### Documentation\n\n- Aligned docstrings with the code and fixed docstring formatting (#1293)\n\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.283\n- CI: skip wheels over PyPI's per-file limit instead of failing the release (#1309)\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.160/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.160\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.159", "id": 395032200, "tag_name": "v0.2.159", "name": "v0.2.159", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-09-23T20:27:34Z", "published_at": "2026-09-23T20:27:36Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.281\n- Pinned default model for e2e tests to `claude-opus-5` to work around CI failures with the CLI's new default model (#1287)\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.159/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.159\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.158", "id": 394233831, "tag_name": "v0.2.158", "name": "v0.2.158", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-09-23T01:40:25Z", "published_at": "2026-09-23T01:40:27Z", "body": "\n### New Features\n\n- **`verbatim_prompts` option**: Added `ClaudeAgentOptions.verbatim_prompts` (default `False`). When `True`, user messages are delivered to the CLI exactly as written — no `@path` file expansion and no slash-command dispatch. This prevents untrusted text inlined into prompts from triggering unintended file reads or command execution. Works with `query()`, `ClaudeSDKClient.connect()`, and `ClaudeSDKClient.query()` for both string and async-iterable prompts. Requires CLI 2.1.248+; a warning is logged on older CLIs. (#1269)\n\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.280\n- CI improvements: recompressed wheels and raised the PyPI pre-flight threshold (#1283)\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.158/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.158\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.156", "id": 391174636, "tag_name": "v0.2.156", "name": "v0.2.156", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-09-18T02:27:57Z", "published_at": "2026-09-18T02:28:01Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.276\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.156/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.156\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.155", "id": 391105989, "tag_name": "v0.2.155", "name": "v0.2.155", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-09-17T22:49:57Z", "published_at": "2026-09-17T22:50:04Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.275\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.155/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.155\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.154", "id": 390355140, "tag_name": "v0.2.154", "name": "v0.2.154", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-09-17T00:27:00Z", "published_at": "2026-09-17T00:27:03Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.274\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.154/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.154\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.153", "id": 389463736, "tag_name": "v0.2.153", "name": "v0.2.153", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-09-15T20:38:06Z", "published_at": "2026-09-15T20:38:09Z", "body": "\n### New Features\n\n- **`snapshot` option for system prompts**: Added a `snapshot` field to `SystemPromptPreset` and a new `SystemPromptCustom` typed dict. When `snapshot` is True, the session keeps the system prompt recorded on its first request, improving prompt-caching behavior across resumed sessions. When False, the prompt is rebuilt on every request, useful for iterating on `append` text. Requires CLI 2.1.257+ (#1268)\n\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.273\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.153/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.153\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.152", "id": 381618248, "tag_name": "v0.2.152", "name": "v0.2.152", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-09-02T22:48:49Z", "published_at": "2026-09-02T22:48:51Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.259\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.152/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.152\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.151", "id": 380867768, "tag_name": "v0.2.151", "name": "v0.2.151", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-09-01T22:47:35Z", "published_at": "2026-09-01T22:47:40Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.258\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.151/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.151\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.150", "id": 380720404, "tag_name": "v0.2.150", "name": "v0.2.150", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-09-01T18:08:06Z", "published_at": "2026-09-01T18:08:08Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.257\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.150/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.150\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.149", "id": 380018468, "tag_name": "v0.2.149", "name": "v0.2.149", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-08-31T20:02:44Z", "published_at": "2026-08-31T20:02:47Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.252\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.149/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.149\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.148", "id": 378690867, "tag_name": "v0.2.148", "name": "v0.2.148", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-08-28T18:34:52Z", "published_at": "2026-08-28T18:34:55Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.251\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.148/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.148\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.147", "id": 378205878, "tag_name": "v0.2.147", "name": "v0.2.147", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-08-28T01:03:43Z", "published_at": "2026-08-28T01:03:46Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.250\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.147/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.147\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.146", "id": 378158893, "tag_name": "v0.2.146", "name": "v0.2.146", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-08-27T22:26:40Z", "published_at": "2026-08-27T22:26:42Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.248\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.146/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.146\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.145", "id": 377493992, "tag_name": "v0.2.145", "name": "v0.2.145", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-08-27T00:25:38Z", "published_at": "2026-08-27T00:25:41Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.247\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.145/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.145\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.144", "id": 376762459, "tag_name": "v0.2.144", "name": "v0.2.144", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-08-25T22:47:07Z", "published_at": "2026-08-25T22:47:09Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.246\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.144/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.144\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.143", "id": 374022309, "tag_name": "v0.2.143", "name": "v0.2.143", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-08-20T20:48:56Z", "published_at": "2026-08-20T20:48:58Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.238\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.143/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.143\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.142", "id": 373433531, "tag_name": "v0.2.142", "name": "v0.2.142", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-08-20T01:08:50Z", "published_at": "2026-08-20T01:08:55Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.237\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.142/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.142\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.141", "id": 373327778, "tag_name": "v0.2.141", "name": "v0.2.141", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-08-19T20:20:50Z", "published_at": "2026-08-19T20:20:54Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.236\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.141/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.141\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.140", "id": 372639694, "tag_name": "v0.2.140", "name": "v0.2.140", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-08-18T20:58:31Z", "published_at": "2026-08-18T20:58:34Z", "body": "\n### New Features\n\n- **MCP 2.x support for in-process SDK MCP servers**: The SDK now supports `mcp` 2.x alongside 1.x (dependency widened to `mcp>=1.23.0,<3.0.0`). In-process servers are served over mcp's own in-memory transport instead of hand-rolled JSON-RPC dispatch, so hand-built `mcp.server.Server` instances now work at full fidelity — resources, prompts, and all result content types reach the CLI verbatim. Tool cancellation on interrupt is supported on mcp 2.x. `claude_agent_sdk.ToolAnnotations` accepts both camelCase and snake_case hint names on every mcp version (#1218)\n- **`forward_subagent_text` option**: New `forward_subagent_text` boolean on `ClaudeAgentOptions` forwards a subagent's text and thinking blocks as messages in the stream, so consumers can render the full nested transcript. Matches the TypeScript SDK's `forwardSubagentText` (#1206)\n- **`ResultError` exception with structured error payload**: When the CLI exits after a terminal error result, the SDK now raises `ResultError` (a subclass of `ProcessError`) instead of a bare \"exit code 1\" error. Carries `subtype`, `errors`, `result`, `api_error_status`, `terminal_reason`, `session_id`, and the raw `data` dict so"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.139", "id": 370856137, "tag_name": "v0.2.139", "name": "v0.2.139", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-08-14T22:35:51Z", "published_at": "2026-08-14T22:35:53Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.233\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.139/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.139\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.138", "id": 370269697, "tag_name": "v0.2.138", "name": "v0.2.138", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-08-13T23:44:36Z", "published_at": "2026-08-13T23:44:38Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.232\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.138/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.138\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.137", "id": 369531768, "tag_name": "v0.2.137", "name": "v0.2.137", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-08-12T21:11:10Z", "published_at": "2026-08-12T21:11:13Z", "body": "\n### New Features\n\n- **`ConversationResetMessage` for conversation reset events**: The SDK now surfaces the CLI's `conversation_reset` frame as a `ConversationResetMessage` dataclass, letting applications detect when a `/clear` or other transcript-discarding flow resets the conversation mid-session. Includes `new_conversation_id`, `uuid`, and `session_id` fields. This widens the `Message` union — code that exhaustively matches with `assert_never` will need updating (#1196)\n- **Message origin on `UserMessage` and `ResultMessage`**: New `origin: MessageOrigin | None` field on `UserMessage` and `ResultMessage` surfaces why a turn was initiated — distinguishing application-submitted prompts (`\"human\"`) from background-task notifications, scheduled triggers, peer messages, and other session-injected turns. New exported types: `MessageOrigin`, `MessageOriginKind`, `TaskNotificationOriginSubkind` (#1199)\n- **`resume_session_at` / `resume_drops_turn` options for truncating resume**: `ClaudeAgentOptions` now supports `resume_session_at` (fork a session at an earlier transcript entry) and `resume_drops_turn` (validate that only entries from a specific turn are discarded). Enables safe rewind"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.136", "id": 368828384, "tag_name": "v0.2.136", "name": "v0.2.136", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-08-11T20:10:48Z", "published_at": "2026-08-11T20:10:50Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.228\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.136/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.136\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.135", "id": 368252085, "tag_name": "v0.2.135", "name": "v0.2.135", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-08-10T23:20:48Z", "published_at": "2026-08-10T23:20:50Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.227\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.135/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.135\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.134", "id": 367093131, "tag_name": "v0.2.134", "name": "v0.2.134", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-08-08T03:01:09Z", "published_at": "2026-08-08T03:01:11Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.226\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.134/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.134\n```\n"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/releases/tag/v0.2.133", "id": 367076785, "tag_name": "v0.2.133", "name": "v0.2.133", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-08-08T01:26:45Z", "published_at": "2026-08-08T01:26:51Z", "body": "\n### Internal/Other Changes\n\n- Updated bundled Claude CLI to version 2.1.225\n\n\n---\n\n**PyPI:** https://pypi.org/project/claude-agent-sdk/0.2.133/\n\n```bash\npip install claude-agent-sdk==0.2.133\n```\n"}]